    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-catalog\" style=\"background: repeat rgb(255, 255, 255); color: #333333; font-family: &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, sans-serif; margin: 0px auto; max-width: 800px; padding: 20px;\">\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiwe4gmhy0Culo_BxENgY3IXoeoaWbLIuzFfZB0G73jDfx2xAoeTYcBKUPVlqA6QcLrRNXkwicmnVj30LTU5907sb_-rJP4uuEGJSjzKaItcD2czHHnWnGJRvEuSR6Q_cuFaoslcQ9iK1VzKaqnn9Iby3DTTH2K09tHH-um-4Hwi2qt7QC2X_nH7lXuiJ1W\" style=\"box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 0px 10px 30px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div>\n\n    <h2 style=\"color: #333333; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 40px; text-align: center;\">BONG報第 386 期 • 目錄</h2>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px; padding: 0px 10px;\">\n        <h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/blog-post.html\">封面圖</a></h3><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/e.html\">編輯室ê話</a></h3><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">聲明稿</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">6</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/kah.html\">獨尊華語，違法無據<br />—要求政府落實國際人權公約，保障教育自主kah參政平等權</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\"><br /></div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">做伙來唸詩</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">1</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/tue.html\">攑香tuè拜</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 洪月珠</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">2</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/blog-post_18.html\">梅仔</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 韓滿</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">3</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/blog-post_849.html\">查某人</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 阿墨</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">4</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/tua-kha-poo-kang-boo-poo.html\">Tuā Kha-pôo Kang-bóo<br />大跤pôo江某</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 陳意榕</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">阿瑞 --ā話仙</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">8</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/kah_01704220398.html\">炭空kah輕便鐵枝路</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 藍春瑞</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">是按怎án-ne生</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">10</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/an-ne.html\">雨水我問你</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 洪明道</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">台灣人寫真</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">14</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/seh.html\">媽孫仔se̍h廟會</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 林榮淑</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">15</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/blog-post_613.html\">月娘</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 簡綾仙</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">16</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/tsiah.html\">雙手抱孩兒，tsiah知爸母時</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 顧怡君</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">心內話</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">18</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/e_0576457554.html\">台語「露」——心目中ê台灣國</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 張祖寧</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">生活ê藝術</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">20</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/e_03390994.html\">田園離療日誌——清明篇（一）</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 鄭清和</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">台灣好食mi̍h</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">24</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/mih.html\">台中滋味——大麵鹼</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 洪健勛</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">25</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/mih-tioh-ai-tsit.html\">炸醬麵，tio̍h-ài tsit味</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 張寶明</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">26</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/mih_01210849039.html\">滴粿</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 張瀠文</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">台語sa攏有</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">28</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/sa-ham.html\">自鬼仔古講起： <br />鬼魂書寫hām歷史記持</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">主講／張嘉祥<br />記錄／蔡玉薰</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">Lán來講看māi</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">32</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/lanmai-e.html\">語言是傳統戲曲ê靈魂</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 陳育萱</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">逐家來phò-tāu</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">36</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/pho-tau-e.html\">厝跤ê鳥仔</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 林麗能</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">Sann-kap讀小說</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">40</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/05/sann-kap-ka-choah.html\">Ka-choa̍h人（二）</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 杜信龍</div>\n                        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgJ2YqGOW7HuWr9GnK0WbJBTSMq6yE7YTz7uYgwh6V4EFEabX7MEpXng3L0mRbqHwDPmW507J7V_zfjGQsU3MWwHklRz_YuK04yEELzQuCfwLP2WqTkV9esqQqf4MP4BK8HwKF8uqw9knYqE8b--bUyQ1dn2fRs07Q7tmzvkJ7ireLY9v3kbP0ZFv3kdous\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiqir2p_GTeLZAw_Go7QGeeYTnMZImAycyg8NgjuNfoJIx5MA7prDMdf0pcN7_2zH--ro38I7c_85xWKRooTegI5-wGDqIthJuBviHk8zF4r_HgcE0RtSdlUMW1TADV04YqVcvnk_EBoZIn7tybGFDcE9aSbISVGco1JpUxOacxJLeN6fl7tI4zavhSqH_a\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiTTu-D2GM9ys1ukLuH8l57x4Jre3U2KWvSfqI_LeCLvvkZn1AOJRe2vXW7HQG3F9iOlHmaBmfk6ABhcgWLxtjYOZ5Sk-5WZivj1Oz-CJCHft3RCzDp6JMsHNkaEUca2LAMUob9tZQjHIEpJzESKcC-eXb6Ru4yqgQGrkzAC0r5LikyR-1zgp7O8T6zpcd7\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); margin-top: 20px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 386期，2026年05月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br />\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br />\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
